---
description: Explore only evidence-supported scope, mode, release and risk alternatives.
args:{scope:GoalContract;positions:StakeholderPosition[];conflicts:RequirementConflict[];unresolved:DraftRequirementConflict[]}
returns:CompromiseAlternative[]
---
For each conflict produce alternatives with preserved outcomes, named concessions, assumptions and affected stakeholders. Keep hard constraints and exact rights boundaries unchanged. Add a no-agreement option and retain unresolved conflicts as blockers rather than inventing a compromise.
